Disable Remote Settings and telemetry antifeatures in Abrowser.

Interceptions sit at stable source chokepoints and return the benign empty shape
callers expect so consumers degrade gracefully instead of throwing.

  services/settings/Utils.sys.mjs                        - allow-list + sync + attachments base URL
  services/settings/RemoteSettingsClient.sys.mjs         - sync no-op + attachment download (subclass)
  services/settings/Attachments.sys.mjs                  - attachment download (base)
  services/settings/remote-settings.sys.mjs              - poller narrowed to allow-list
  toolkit/components/telemetry/app/TelemetrySend.sys.mjs - ping transport

